       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MULTIPLICATION-TABLE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TABLE-NUMBER PIC 99 VALUE 5.
       01 COUNTER-VALUE PIC 99 VALUE 1.
       01 RESULT-VALUE PIC 999 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING COUNTER-VALUE FROM 1 BY 1
               UNTIL COUNTER-VALUE > 10
               COMPUTE RESULT-VALUE = TABLE-NUMBER * COUNTER-VALUE
               DISPLAY TABLE-NUMBER " X " COUNTER-VALUE " = "
                       RESULT-VALUE
           END-PERFORM.
           STOP RUN.
